---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="Sports" description="Diving, skiing, lifeguarding, and co-heading a girls' weightlifting club." slug="sports">
  <section class="section section--tight">
    <span class="eyebrow">Sports</span>
    <h1 style="font-size:clamp(2rem,4vw,2.8rem); margin-top:0.5rem;">Off the Drafting Table</h1>
    <p class="lede">
      Photos are still coming for most of this — for now, here's what fills the rest of my time.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="sports-grid reveal-group">
      <div class="sports-card">
        <span class="sports-card__meta">Co-head · 2023–Present</span>
        <h3 class="sports-card__label">Girls Who Lift</h3>
        <p>Co-head of Exeter's girls-only weightlifting club — fostering a non-judgmental gym community where girls can confidently work out and have fun.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="sports-card">
        <span class="sports-card__meta">Since childhood</span>
        <h3 class="sports-card__label">Skiing</h3>
        <p>Certified ski instructor, volunteering every winter at a local alpine racing camp. Raced alpine and mogul skiing through elementary and middle school.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="sports-card">
        <span class="sports-card__meta">Varsity · 2024–Present</span>
        <h3 class="sports-card__label">Diving</h3>
        <p>Member of the school's varsity diving team.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="sports-card">
        <span class="sports-card__meta">Certified · 2026–Present</span>
        <h3 class="sports-card__label">Lifeguarding</h3>
        <p>American Red Cross certified lifeguard.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="sports-card">
        <span class="sports-card__meta">2024–2025</span>
        <h3 class="sports-card__label">Rowing</h3>
        <p>Rowed at Exeter.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="sports-card sports-card--placeholder">
        <span class="sports-card__meta">Coming soon</span>
        <h3 class="sports-card__label">Dance</h3>
        <p>Details and photos on the way.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
